{
  "assessment_scope": "Workflow-final-verification, governed-final, VP1-final-readiness for change 2026-09-17-retire-feature-format-support on codex/retire-spec-support. Distinct Verify after completed M1 and fresh independent whole-change Code Review; includes Git/PR handoff basis, complete retirement diff, retained protection, generated resources and current workflow evidence.",
  "change_id": "2026-09-17-retire-feature-format-support",
  "changes": [
    "Retired feature/proof operational guidance, grammar parsers, adoption-classification handling and exclusive canonical/projection resources; retained source interpretation and explicitly authorized living-Design adoption.",
    "Revised the single compact method and eight projections to preserve four-question scanning, eight risk dimensions, actual interactions and correct Design-versus-Plan gap ownership without BND/INT/PRF records.",
    "Made unsupported specs inputs fail without content reads or mutation and removed the spec CLI default/configuration kind; preserved current models/catalogs, historical deletion routing, other location kinds and record safety.",
    "Removed exclusive tests and six static fixtures, retained/reworked current safety observations and reconciled model/catalog coverage, package inventory and support-change communication."
  ],
